  "description": "Taking it to the park or pump track, the Steel reserve 1.1 is the weapon of choice. Featuring an integrated internal head tube and full 4130 chromoly suspension corrected frame, forks and cranks, the Steel Reserve 1.1 can handle as much abuse as you can deliver while still possessing the light and agile qualities of a legendary Haro BMX bike.\nFull 4130 chromoly frame with integrated head tube, Euro BB shell, and horizontal dropouts\nFull 4130 chromoly fork with 31.8mm legs, suspension corrected\nAvailable in Short (21.8\" TT) and Long (22.3\" TT)\nThree-piece chromoly 175mm 8-spline cranks with 25t sprocket\nWeinmann ZAC 19 double-wall rims\nTektro IO mechanical disc brake with 6\" rotor\nKenda K-Rad 2.3\" tires",
